    "drift. The renderer keeps its own richer presentation model, but for any",
    "artifact it surfaces, its cleanup posture must agree with the verdict the",
    "scanners attach to the same observed evidence.",
    "Policy: a conventional basename alone justifies discovery, never verified",
    "disposability. Verified requires corroborating context: direct toolchain",
    "signatures, a parent basename that makes the name specific, or sibling",
    "project manifests that establish both identity and a reinstall path.",
    "Identity is not recoverability: a Maven local repository stays review-only",
    "because locally installed artifacts have no remote to re-download."
